um-dot-decimal" id="ixv-11893">376,889</ix:nonFraction></span></td> <td>&#160;</td> </tr></tbody></table></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric>  <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</span></p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt;"></span></p><!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 19; Value: 1 --><div style="margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; padding-bottom: 0.01pt; border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid;"><p style="text-align: center; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><!-- Field: Sequence; Type: Arabic; Name: PageNo -->17<!-- Field: /Sequence --><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt;"></span></p></div><div style="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><p style="text-align: center; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</span></p></div><!-- Field: /Page --><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>  <ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:SegmentReportingDisclosureTextBlock" contextRef="cref_1315438858" escape="true" id="ixv-7268"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><tbody><tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top;"><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.5in;">9<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt;">.</span></td> <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt;">SEGMENT                                             REPORTING</span></td> </tr></tbody></table> <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0.25in; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</span></p> <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: justify;"> <span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt;">We organize and manage our business by the following <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:fc_145321921;">two</span> segments which meet the definition of reportable segments under ASC280-10, Segment Reporting: Sales of Goods and Services. These segments are based on the customer type of products or services provided and are the same as our business units. <ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:SegmentReportingCodmProfitLossMeasureHowUsedDescription" contextRef="cref_1315438858" id="ixv-7281">Separate financial information is available and regularly reviewed by our chief operating - decision maker, who is our <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:fc_303643965;">chief executive officer</span>, in making resource allocation decisions for our segments. </ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfSegmentReportingInformationBySegmentTextBlock" contextRef="cref_1315438858" continuedAt="continuation_134653147" escape="true" id="ixv-11894">Our chief officer decision maker evaluates segment performance to the GAAP measure of gross profit.</ix:nonNumeric></span> </p> <ix:continuation id="continuation_134653147"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0.5in; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</span></p> <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" sty